===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} {{term|picois|lang=fro}}, later alteration due to folk etymology association with [[pick]] and [[axe]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈpɪkˌæks/}}
* {{audio|En-us-pickaxe.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
